<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Harikrishna Pillai | AI & Neuroscience</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
    <!-- <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script> -->
     <script>
    window.MathJax = {
      tex: {
        inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\(', '\\)']], // Allow $ for inline
        displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\[', '\\]']] // Allow $$ for block
      },
      svg: {
        fontCache: 'global'
      }
    };
    </script>

    <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="layout">
        <aside>
            <div class="brand">
                <h1>Harikrishna<br>Pillai</h1>
                <p class="tagline">Love Science <3</p>
            </div>
            <nav>
                <a href="#home" class="active">/home</a>
                <a href="#about">/about</a>
                <a href="#projects">/projects</a>
                <a href="#notes">/scientific_notes</a>
            </nav>
            <div class="socials">
                <a href="https://github.com/Harikrishna-AL" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
                <a href="./Hari_cv.pdf" target="_blank">CV</a>
                <a href="mailto:hari3032003@gmail.com">Email</a>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <main>
            
            <section id="home">
                <div class="canvas-container">
                    <canvas id="mathCanvas"></canvas>
                    <div class="overlay-stats">
                        <span class="stat-label">MODEL STATE:</span> <span id="model-status">LEARNING...</span><br>
                        <span class="stat-label">DISTRIBUTION:</span> GAUSSIAN MIXTURE
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="intro-text">
                    <h2>Continual Learning &<br>Adaptive Intelligence</h2>
                    <p>Working on the intersection of AI and Neuroscience. Building systems that can continually learn without forgetting.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="about">
                <h3 class="section-header">01. About Me</h3>
                <div class="text-block">
                    <p>
                        Student at <strong>Technische Universität Dresden</strong>, Germany, pursuing a Master’s degree in Computational Modelling and Simulation.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                         Experimenting with Neuroscience and Nature inspired AI topics. Working on Continual Learning to create general and adaptive Neural Networks. 
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Beyond research, I enjoy Game Development and 3D Graphics (Unity, Godot, Blender).
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="projects">
                <h3 class="section-header">02. Selected Projects</h3>
                <div class="grid">
                    
                    <a href="https://appflowy.com/07ca7474-1e31-4ae7-9af2-abdc07ffecc5/CAN-Continuously-Adapting-Networks-5132ed1b-28ec-4297-9858-ed5c6b6cb7a5" target="_blank" class="card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h4>Continuously Adaptive Networks</h4>
                            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Solving catastrophic forgetting using a hybrid of supervised and unsupervised learning techniques.</p>
                        <div class="tags"><span>Continual Learning</span><span>Research</span></div>
                    </a>

                    <a href="https://github.com/Harikrishna-AL/MusicAI_Evolver" target="_blank" class="card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h4>MusicAI Evolver</h4>
                            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Experimental system using Particle Swarm Optimization (PSO) to evolve and compose music based on audio input.</p>
                        <div class="tags"><span>Evolutionary Algo</span><span>Audio</span></div>
                    </a>

                    <a href="https://github.com/Harikrishna-AL/sasta_skit" target="_blank" class="card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h4>Sasta Skit</h4>
                            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Automated call center simulation using VoiceAI and generative models.</p>
                        <div class="tags"><span>GenAI</span><span>Voice</span></div>
                    </a>

                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="notes">
                <h3 class="section-header">03. Scientific Notes</h3>
                
                <div class="notes-list">
                    <% posts.forEach(post => { %>
                        <a href="/posts/<%= post.slug %>" class="note-link-item">
                            <span class="note-date"><%= post.date %></span>
                            <span class="note-title"><%= post.title %></span>
                            <span class="note-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                        </a>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>
            </section>

            <footer>
                <p>&copy; 2025 Harikrishna Pillai.</p>
            </footer>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>